{"seq":2,"slug":"session-management","title":"会话管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/infrastructure/session-management","wordCount":1503,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"会话管理\">会话管理</h1><p>会话（Session）是玩家与服务器之间逻辑连接的完整生命周期——从认证握手到优雅断开或超时清理。会话管理的质量直接决定了玩家在网络波动时的体验：是无缝重连还是被踢回大厅。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>会话是一个状态机，经历 Connecting→Authenticating→Active→(Suspended→Reconnecting)→Disconnecting 的完整生命周期。核心设计要素包括：Token 认证分离（Auth Service 签发、游戏服务器验证）、断线重连（服务器保持 Suspended 状态 + Reconnect Token）、会话迁移（跨服原子转移）、以及基于平滑 RTT 估算的自适应心跳检测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"会话生命周期状态机\">会话生命周期状态机</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Connecting: 客户端发起连接&#10;    Connecting --&gt; Authenticating: TCP/UDP 握手完成&#10;    Authenticating --&gt; Active: Token 验证通过&#10;    Authenticating --&gt; Rejected: Token 无效/过期&#10;    Rejected --&gt; [*]&#10;    Active --&gt; Disconnecting: 客户端主动断开&#10;    Active --&gt; Suspended: 网络中断检测&#10;    Suspended --&gt; Reconnecting: 客户端重连请求&#10;    Suspended --&gt; Expired: 超时未重连&#10;    Reconnecting --&gt; Active: 重连验证通过&#10;    Reconnecting --&gt; Rejected: 重连 Token 无效&#10;    Disconnecting --&gt; [*]&#10;    Expired --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Connecting: 客户端发起连接\n    Connecting --&gt; Authenticating: TCP/UDP 握手完成\n    Authenticating --&gt; Active: Token 验证通过\n    Authenticating --&gt; Rejected: Token 无效/过期\n    Rejected --&gt; [*]\n    Active --&gt; Disconnecting: 客户端主动断开\n    Active --&gt; Suspended: 网络中断检测\n    Suspended --&gt; Reconnecting: 客户端重连请求\n    Suspended --&gt; Expired: 超时未重连\n    Reconnecting --&gt; Active: 重连验证通过\n    Reconnecting --&gt; Rejected: 重连 Token 无效\n    Disconnecting --&gt; [*]\n    Expired --&gt; [*]</pre><p>每个状态转换都有明确的超时约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态转换</th>\n<th>超时阈值</th>\n<th>超时后动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Connecting → Authenticating</td>\n<td>5s</td>\n<td>关闭连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Authenticating → Active</td>\n<td>10s</td>\n<td>拒绝并关闭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Active → Suspended（心跳丢失）</td>\n<td>3-5s</td>\n<td>标记为 Suspended</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Suspended → Expired</td>\n<td>30-120s</td>\n<td>清理会话，通知其他玩家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reconnecting → Active</td>\n<td>10s</td>\n<td>降级为新连接流程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"认证握手流程\">认证握手流程</h2><p>游戏服务器通常不直接处理账号密码——认证由独立的 Auth Service 完成，服务器只验证 Token。</p>\n<p>典型流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>客户端向 Auth Service 请求 Session Token（短时效，5-30 分钟）</li>\n<li>客户端携带 Token 连接游戏服务器</li>\n<li>服务器向 Auth Service 验证 Token 有效性（或本地验证 JWT 签名）</li>\n<li>验证通过 → 分配玩家 Slot，加载玩家数据</li>\n<li>向客户端发送初始世界状态快照</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>认证方式</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JWT 本地验证</td>\n<td>&lt;1ms</td>\n<td>中（Token 撤销延迟）</td>\n<td>匹配制游戏（Token 生命短）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Auth Service 远程验证</td>\n<td>5-20ms</td>\n<td>高（实时撤销）</td>\n<td>MMO（长连接，需实时封禁）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双重验证</td>\n<td>5-20ms</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>竞技排位 + 反作弊联动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"断线重连机制\">断线重连机制</h2><p>断线重连是会话管理中最关键的功能。在移动网络环境下，玩家可能因为进电梯、切换 Wi-Fi/4G 而短暂断线，如果每次都需要重新匹配和加载，体验会极差。</p>\n<p><strong>服务器端保持会话的设计</strong>：</p>\n<p>当检测到玩家断线（心跳超时）时，服务器不立即销毁该玩家的状态，而是将其标记为 Suspended：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>玩家角色进入&quot;托管状态&quot;（站立不动 / AI 接管 / 无敌保护，取决于游戏设计）</li>\n<li>会话数据保留在内存中，包含最后的认证上下文和游戏状态</li>\n<li>分配一个 Reconnect Token（一次性，绑定到此会话）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>客户端重连流程</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>客户端检测到连接断开</li>\n<li>尝试使用 Reconnect Token 连接同一服务器实例</li>\n<li>服务器验证 Token → 恢复会话上下文</li>\n<li>发送 Delta 快照（从断线时刻到当前的状态变化）</li>\n<li>客户端追赶完成 → 恢复正常游戏</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>reconnect</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>network_restore</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>auth_verify</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>state_sync</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{reconnect}} = T_{\\text{network\\_restore}} + T_{\\text{auth\\_verify}} + T_{\\text{state\\_sync}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reconnect</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">network_restore</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">auth_verify</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">state_sync</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>优秀的重连实现可以将 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>reconnect</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{reconnect}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reconnect</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压缩到 1-3 秒。</p>\n<h2 id=\"会话亲和性与迁移\">会话亲和性与迁移</h2><p><strong>会话亲和性（Session Affinity）</strong> 指让同一个玩家的请求始终路由到同一个服务器实例。在匹配制游戏中这是天然的——玩家被分配到特定实例后直到匹配结束都连接该实例。</p>\n<p><strong>会话迁移</strong>发生在以下场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>服务器需要维护重启（Rolling Update）</li>\n<li>玩家从一个区域移动到另一个区域（MMO 跨服）</li>\n<li>负载再平衡（某实例过载）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>迁移协议必须保证原子性：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant S1 as 源服务器&#10;    participant S2 as 目标服务器&#10;    participant Coord as 协调服务&#10;    S1-&gt;&gt;Coord: 请求迁移 Player_X&#10;    Coord-&gt;&gt;S2: 预分配 Slot&#10;    S2-&gt;&gt;Coord: Slot 已就绪&#10;    Coord-&gt;&gt;S1: 开始迁移&#10;    S1-&gt;&gt;S1: 冻结 Player_X 状态&#10;    S1-&gt;&gt;S2: 传输状态快照&#10;    S2-&gt;&gt;S2: 加载状态&#10;    S2-&gt;&gt;Coord: 状态加载完成&#10;    Coord-&gt;&gt;C: 切换连接到 S2&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S2: 建立新连接&#10;    S2-&gt;&gt;C: 确认迁移完成&#10;    Coord-&gt;&gt;S1: 释放旧 Slot\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant S1 as 源服务器\n    participant S2 as 目标服务器\n    participant Coord as 协调服务\n    S1-&gt;&gt;Coord: 请求迁移 Player_X\n    Coord-&gt;&gt;S2: 预分配 Slot\n    S2-&gt;&gt;Coord: Slot 已就绪\n    Coord-&gt;&gt;S1: 开始迁移\n    S1-&gt;&gt;S1: 冻结 Player_X 状态\n    S1-&gt;&gt;S2: 传输状态快照\n    S2-&gt;&gt;S2: 加载状态\n    S2-&gt;&gt;Coord: 状态加载完成\n    Coord-&gt;&gt;C: 切换连接到 S2\n    C-&gt;&gt;S2: 建立新连接\n    S2-&gt;&gt;C: 确认迁移完成\n    Coord-&gt;&gt;S1: 释放旧 Slot</pre><p>关键要求：从客户端视角，迁移过程中最多只有 1-2 秒的卡顿，不应出现状态丢失或重复操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"心跳与连接健康检测\">心跳与连接健康检测</h2><p>心跳机制是检测连接是否存活的基础。设计要点：</p>\n<p><strong>双向心跳</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>服务器 → 客户端：每 1-2 秒发送 Ping，要求客户端回复 Pong</li>\n<li>客户端 → 服务器：每次正常数据包都算作一次隐式心跳</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>RTT 测量</strong>：</p>\n<p>心跳包同时用于测量往返延迟（RTT）。服务器记录发送 Ping 的时间戳，收到 Pong 后计算差值。RTT 的指数移动平均值用于延迟补偿计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>RTT</mtext><mtext>smooth</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>RTT</mtext><mtext>sample</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>RTT</mtext><mtext>prev</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RTT}_{\\text{smooth}} = \\alpha \\times \\text{RTT}_{\\text{sample}} + (1 - \\alpha) \\times \\text{RTT}_{\\text{prev}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">smooth</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sample</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prev</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>典型的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 值为 0.125（与 TCP 的 SRTT 计算一致）。</p>\n<p><strong>断线判定策略</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>判定条件</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>严格</td>\n<td>连续 3 次心跳未回复</td>\n<td>快速检测，释放资源</td>\n<td>网络抖动时误判</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宽松</td>\n<td>连续 10 秒无任何包</td>\n<td>容忍短暂波动</td>\n<td>占用资源更久</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应</td>\n<td>基于历史 RTT 动态调整阈值</td>\n<td>兼顾两者</td>\n<td>实现复杂度高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"并发连接上限\">并发连接上限</h2><p>单个服务器实例的并发连接数受多个因素限制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>瓶颈因素</th>\n<th>理论上限</th>\n<th>实际约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文件描述符（Linux）</td>\n<td>1M+ (可配置)</td>\n<td>通常设为 65535</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存（每连接开销）</td>\n<td>取决于总内存</td>\n<td>每连接 2-10KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU（每连接处理）</td>\n<td>取决于核数 × Tick Rate</td>\n<td>实时模拟的硬约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带宽</td>\n<td>网卡容量</td>\n<td>10Gbps 网卡 ÷ 每玩家带宽</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对于 64Hz 的竞技射击，每玩家每秒消耗约 10-30KB 带宽。10Gbps 网卡的理论承载：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>41666</mn><mtext> 个连接</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\max} = \\frac{10 \\times 10^9 / 8}{30 \\times 10^3} \\approx 41666 \\text{ 个连接}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2604em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/8</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">41666</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">个连接</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但 CPU 通常在远低于此数字时就先触顶——64Hz 下每 Tick 对每个玩家执行物理模拟和碰撞检测，100 个玩家的单 Tick 预算可能就消耗了全部 16ms。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>会话管理是玩家感知的&quot;连接质量&quot;的直接决定者。良好的断线重连（1-3 秒恢复）、自适应心跳（兼顾快检测和低误判）、原子迁移协议（零状态丢失）构成了生产级会话系统的三根支柱。并发连接上限通常由 CPU 计算预算先于网络带宽或内存触顶。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"server-scaling-patterns\">服务器扩缩容模式</a>解释实例如何被分配给会话；<a href=\"persistence-database\">持久化与数据库</a>描述会话结束后玩家数据的归档策略。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"会话管理","id":"会话管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"会话生命周期状态机","id":"会话生命周期状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"认证握手流程","id":"认证握手流程"},{"level":2,"text":"断线重连机制","id":"断线重连机制"},{"level":2,"text":"会话亲和性与迁移","id":"会话亲和性与迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"心跳与连接健康检测","id":"心跳与连接健康检测"},{"level":2,"text":"并发连接上限","id":"并发连接上限"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"服务器扩缩容模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/infrastructure/server-scaling-patterns"},"next":{"title":"持久化与数据库选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/infrastructure/persistence-database"}}